Tesla remains the leading EV manufacturer, but other companies such as Volkswagen and General Motors are gaining ground. Startups and Chinese companies are entering the EV market, increasing competition and driving innovation. Companies are forming partnerships to share resources, reduce costs, and improve supply chains.

