Governments are implementing stricter emission standards to encourage EV adoption and reduce greenhouse gas emissions. Tax incentives and subsidies are being offered to encourage EV adoption, but their effectiveness is debated. Governments are launching public awareness campaigns to promote EV adoption and educate consumers about the benefits of EVs.

